Address: {street1}
Street: {street2}

Match on street name only. Ignore house numbers, suite numbers, and PO boxes. Allow abbreviations (Ave/Avenue, St/Street), common misspellings, and language variants (Rue, Straße, etc.).

Answer with exactly one word: Yes or No.

